distribute them. It does not
permit redistribution of the unchanged original templates or preview files.

Third-party components keep their own licences; see the complete notices in
`THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md`. Their licence terms prevail over these terms. Nothing
in this licence restricts rights granted by a third-party licence or mandatory
law, including replacement, modification and reverse engineering needed to
relink a dynamically linked LGPL library. PySide6 (LGPL-3.0) is linked
dynamically and shipped unmodified. Slicers are only ever invoked as
separately installed programs.

Warranty and liability for end users are governed by the End User Licence
Agreement, especially section 11. Nothing in this licence excludes liability
that cannot legally be excluded, including liability for intent or gross
negligence, injury to life, body or health, or mandatory product liability.
